# n8n-nodes-arca

TypeScript n8n community node package. Build icons via Gulp; lint with `eslint-plugin-n8n-nodes-base`.

Resources mirror Arca API: Workspaces, Folders, Lists, Tasks, Statuses, Labels, Comments, User. Keep operations in sync with `arca-server` API.
